 <longdesc><para unique="1091440">Sets the <indexterm><primary>DF (direction) flag, EFLAGS register</primary></indexterm>DF flag in the EFLAGS register. When the DF flag is set to 1, string operations decrement the index regis&#173;ters (<indexterm><primary>ESI register;EDI register</primary></indexterm>ESI and/or EDI). Operation is the same in all modes.</para>
  </longdesc>
 <operation>
  <programlisting>DF := 1;</programlisting>
  </operation>
 <subsection title="Flags Affected">
  <para unique="1091445">The DF flag is set. The CF, OF, ZF, SF, AF, and PF flags are unaffected.</para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Exceptions (All Operating Modes)">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD </term>
    <listitem><para unique="1091447">If the LOCK prefix is used.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
